d diorama that shoots back. Pace Invaders turns a treadmill walk into an arcade run: skeletons, beetles, droids and tin soldiers come down the lane, and every step you take is counted, scored and turned into gold.\n\nFour worlds, one belt. OLD TOWN's high-noon desert. The BUG YARD, three inches above a flowerbed. DEEP SPACE in model-kit grey. A TOY ROOM the size of a carpet. Each world arms you with its own iron, six-shooter to ray gun. Walk ten minutes and the Grand Tour carries you through all four without breaking stride.\n\nBuilt for real treadmills: a passthrough window keeps your actual belt in view, a pace beat matches the game to your real cadence, and the speed you set in the game is the speed you set on your machine. A warm-up lap lets you find your stride before anything comes down the lane.\n\nRequires a treadmill and a clear play area. Attach your treadmill's safety clip, match speeds, adults only on the belt.", "short_description": "Walk your treadmill. Shoot your way through four worlds. Every step counts."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://old-town-shootout.vercel.app/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://old-town-shootout.vercel.app/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Graphikate", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://old-town-shootout.vercel.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes